<title>JAPAN: SUNX to issue 3.5 bln yen convertible.</title>
<headline>SUNX to issue 3.5 bln yen convertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - SUNX Ltd</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TRUSTEE - Tokai Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   1	  AMT   3.5 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISSU PRICE	    MATURITY 31.Mar.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 2.Dec.96   CONV TO 30.Mar.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	     PAY DATE 18.Oct.96  INT PAY end-Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 14-17 Oct</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on October 11.</p>
</text>
